# Reproducible open-source synthesis of the GF-T64 multiplier (yosys, NO Vivado).
#   yosys fpga/gft/synth_gft_mul64.ys
# Targets the Xilinx 7-series primitives of the AX7203 openXC7 flow
# (yosys synth_xilinx -> nextpnr-xilinx). Emits a utilization stat report so the
# 256-bit significand datapath can be sized against the XC7A200T fabric.
read_verilog fpga/gft/gft_mul64.v
hierarchy -top gft_mul64
synth_xilinx -flatten
stat
